  "id": "RUN-z3-boot-variant",
  "title": "Boot's variant, a guard that reads the recipient's balance, lets a transfer overdraw the sender; the corrected guard gives unsat",
  "task": "W1-T12",
  "origin": "recorded",
  "records": "S1.L0 and SP-1.1: the variant's violation is sat with a witness that replays (the cold-start fallback for Boot's cell); the corrected guard, the roadmap's starter, is unsat; an amount above both balances fails the guard; the violating inputs are those with amount > a; with equal balances the variant guard cannot overdraw",
